# (1.5.0, the user's: "instead of the current song's timeline ... the list of songs") the Set page, GLO again (was Song
# mode): SET and the set's name on the rule ("SET 2/2 · ECHOSPACE 12"; none loaded: THE PIECES); the eight pieces by
# name in two columns, the one playing lit, in Set mode the next marked, the pieces past the set's end dimmed; the
# widest name (87 px) in its column; the screen reader's line; the header's battery as on every page. (setlit, setnext,
# setdim, setcut: read from the screen; a knob's big ring, while it shows, covers the list: waited out)
listen
wait 600
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
# no set ever loaded: the pieces, all eight in the set; Endless: no next mark
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 28
said Set page, the pieces, 1 of 8, Basic: Mode Endless, Transition LP, only in Set mode, Store, set 3, Load, 2 sets stored
expect setlit 1
expect setnext 0
expect setdim 0
expect setcut 0
shot setpage_none.png
# Set mode: the next marked (piece 2)
spin K1 2
wait 2500
said Mode Set
expect setnext 2
expect setlit 1
shot setpage_none_setmode.png
# a set of five, "Echospace 12": its five in 1 to 5, 6 to 8 dimmed (Set mode stops before them)
setfile build/scenarios/setpage/five.dub1 0,1,2,3,4 Echospace 12
setin build/scenarios/setpage/five.dub1
expect setlen 5
expect par158 2
# the third playing: lit; the fourth next; 6 to 8 dimmed
piece 2
wait 600
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 1
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 28
said Set page, Echospace 12, playing 3 of 5, Steppers, next Fog: Mode Set, Transition LP, Store, set 3, only when stopped, Load, 2 sets stored
expect setlit 3
expect setnext 8
expect setdim 224
expect setcut 0
shot setpage_set5_playing.png
# Endless: the same list, no next mark
spin K1 -2
wait 2500
said Mode Endless
expect setnext 0
expect setlit 3
expect setdim 224
shot setpage_set5_endless.png
spin K1 2
wait 2500
expect setnext 8
# the set's last piece: no next
piece 4
wait 600
expect setlit 5
expect setnext 0
# a piece past the set's end, chosen by hand: lit; no next; "after the set" said
piece 6
wait 600
expect setlit 7
expect setnext 0
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 600
said Set page, Echospace 12, playing 7, after the set, Pressure: Mode Set
shot setpage_after_set.png
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 0
# the widest name, 87 px (NAME_PX): a piece's and the set's, in its column and on the rule
piece 0
wait 600
name 0 WWWWWWWl
name 4 WWWWWWWl
name -1 WWWWWWWl
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 600
said Set page, WWWWWWWl, 1 of 5, WWWWWWWl, next Chamber: Mode Set
expect setcut 0
expect setlit 1
expect setnext 2
expect setdim 224
shot setpage_widest.png
# a low battery: the header's battery shown (its warning never hidden), the page as it was
usbpower 0
battery 530
wait 600
expect hdrbatt 1
expect setlit 1
expect setcut 0
shot setpage_lowbatt.png
